WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From a Forward Fold, shift weight into one leg and lift the other straight behind you.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Plant the opposite hand on the floor or a block, in line with the standing foot.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Square the hips toward the floor before beginning to twist.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Rotate the torso and reach the top arm toward the ceiling, gaze following the hand.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, breathing steadily, then release with control and switch sides.
